sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Upstream system
    participant API as FastAPI ingest
    participant WF as Temporal workflow
    participant NLP as NLP extraction
    participant Tables as Table detection
    participant Val as Validation layer
    participant Store as Audit store

    Client->>API: Submit ESG document
    API->>WF: Start durable workflow
    par Parallel extractors
        WF->>NLP: Text / entity extraction
        WF->>Tables: Table structure recovery
    end
    NLP-->>WF: Structured fields
    Tables-->>WF: Tabular facts
    WF->>Val: Prompt optimization + checks
    Val-->>WF: Validated payload
    WF->>Store: Persist auditable trail
    WF-->>API: Workflow complete
    API-->>Client: Structured result + status
